<title>USA: TENNIS-DRAW FOR WTA TOUR CHASE CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DRAW FOR WTA TOUR CHASE CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the season-ending $2</p>
<p>million Chase Championships of the Corel WTA Tour starting</p>
<p>next Monday at Madison Square Garden (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Top half</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) v Karen Habsudova (Slovakia), Barbara</p>
<p>Paulus (Austria) v 8-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.)</p>
<p>3-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) v Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands); Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) v 5-Jana Novotna</p>
<p>(Czech Republic)</p>
<p>Bottom half</p>
<p>6-Anke Huber (Germany) v Iva Majoli (Croatia); TBD v</p>
<p>4-Conchita Martinez (Spain)</p>
<p>7-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Irina Spirlea (Romania);</p>
<p>Kimiko Date (Japan) v 2-Monica Seles (U.S.)</p>
</text>
